    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***Last One-Bedroom Apartment Remaining***\r\n\r\nThe one-bedroom apartments at Woodlands Grove offer an exceptional blend of contemporary design, comfort and sustainability in one of South County Dublin’s most sought-after coastal locations. Set within a boutique development of just 26 luxury residences, these beautifully crafted homes are ideal for , first-time buyers or those seeking a stylish base close to the city and the sea.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully crafted by Turkington Rock ,Irelands first interior design led residential developer each apartment is thoughtfully designed to maximise space and natural light, with generous open-plan living and dining areas that flow seamlessly from a bespoke contemporary kitchen. Featuring Quartz Calacatta Gold worktops, bespoke cabinetry and fully integrated Miele appliances, the kitchens combine elegant design with everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nLarge double-glazed windows and private balconies bring the outside in, creating bright living spaces with views over landscaped gardens and leafy surroundings. Bedrooms are designed as calm, comfortable retreats with fitted wardrobes and smart storage solutions, while the bathrooms feature sleek tiling, premium sanitaryware, rain head showers and heated towel rails for a refined finish.\r\n\r\nBuilt with modern living in mind, each home includes an energy-efficient air source heat pump system, LED lighting throughout and an A2 Building Energy Rating. Residents also benefit from secure private parking, lift access, bicycle storage and beautifully landscaped communal grounds.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned between Blackrock Village and the N11, Woodlands Grove offers excellent connectivity, with Dublin Bus just two minutes’ walk away and the DART within easy reach, providing quick access to Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nCombining thoughtful design, premium specification and an outstanding location, the one-bedroom apartments at Woodlands Grove present a rare opportunity to enjoy luxury apartment living in the heart of Blackrock."
      },
